%%label II. Allegro molto
%%note D. A fiddle-style dance, interrupted by spaced chords in three-four, with a gentle trio in G for clarinet.
X:1
T:Copland’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Allegro molto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Aaron Copland
M:2/4
L:1/8
Q:"Allegro molto" 1/4=132
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp pno [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn. I, II"
